<title>USA: Stant Corp Q4 net rises on cost reductions.</title>
<headline>Stant Corp Q4 net rises on cost reductions.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Ind. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stant Corp said Wednesday an increase in earnings in the fourth quarter ended December 31 stemmed primarily from cost reduction programs and increased manufacturing efficiencies.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $5.9 million, or $0.35 a share, compared to $5.4 million, or $0.33 a share, one year ago. Sales increased to $175.4 million from $162.6 million in the fourth quarter of 1995, Stant said.</p>
<p>Stant manufactures automobile windshield wiper systems and other automotive products.</p>
<p>Its shares closed down 1/2 Wednesday at 14.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
